WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.479
Across every dataset and budget, IGP delivers the
highest test accuracy.

00:00:05.559 --> 00:00:11.192
Under twenty labels per class with a GCN, it
reaches 86.4 percent on Cora,

00:00:11.272 --> 00:00:17.369
75.8 on Citeseer, and 83.6 on PubMed, beating the
strongest prior method, GRAIN,

00:00:17.449 --> 00:00:20.689
by 1.6 to 2.2 percent on citation networks,

00:00:20.769 --> 00:00:25.244
with smaller but consistent gains on Reddit and
ogbn-arxiv.

00:00:25.324 --> 00:00:30.880
As budget grows, IGP climbs fastest, and the lead
holds across backbones.
